 tems & Network Science\nSize: L\nSubmission type: Paper-based / poster pa
 pers\nConfidence: estimated\nLast checked date: 2026-10-07\nNotes: Organi
 zer confirms Krakow\, Jul 12-16\, in person. The 2027 CFP still contains 
